sjdevnull@yahoo.com says...

> > Best alignment choice?
> 
> If you don't go artifact wishless, neutral.  Monks at high levels are
> spell-casters, and the Eye is incredible.  Also gives MR, so they can
> keep the robe on.

I'll second this.  The Eye is an excellent wish for any character class, 
but for spellcasters like Monks and Priests, it is so good that it should 
be automatic unless one has a hangup about wishing for artifacts.

> > What are good wishes?
> 
> If you're artifact wishless, speed boots, CoMR, or shield/amulet of
> reflection depending on situation (blessed greased fixed +3 for all).

I get my reflection from SDSM in the mid/late game.  It works fine if you 
max luck and gain some levels.  Against the really tough monsters, you'll 
be using magic missile anyway.  Before then I'll use another source of 
reflection if I find it, but I wouldn't waste a wish on it.

> > Should I get GoPower and kick ass, or G-Dex and stock up on magic?
> 
> Dex, definitely.

Neither is worth a wish.  Early on I would use GoP if I found them.  


